{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"2369","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v331","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"零点","creatorId":"vndb:s2804","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:577","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2804","name":"零点","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:11469","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"七尾奈留(九尾、奈留)","creatorId":"egs:creator:13","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:13","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:13","name":"七尾奈留(九尾、奈留)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:11626","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"七尾 奈留","creatorId":"vndb:s1102","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1102","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1102","name":"七尾 奈留","roleCode":"art","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:8339","source":"vndb"}],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c3126","characterName":"柾木 茜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"73265","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15920"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26974"],"vndbCharacterId":"c3126"},"originalCharacterName":"柾木 茜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"920"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"158cm"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"40kg"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I hate my past.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The three most important things in her life are: Touko-oneechan, her brother, and swimming. If she somehow loses them all, what will she do? What can she do?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Swimming, Martial arts (just a little)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Swimming, being clingy, Touko and Yoshikazu"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Basic Behavior: She always wears a bright smile and expresses herself as openly as she can."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3126"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"第三章登場のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"第三章主人公・柾木良和の義理の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家にこもりがちな兄と違い、元気いっぱいに夏の日差しをうけている水泳少女。透子と義兄の仲を取り持ったのも彼女である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やたらと身体に触れることが好きで、すぐに腕を組んだり頬に触れたりしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この夏は、義兄の起こし方に凝っているらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26974","sourceWorkId":"3940","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あたしは、あたしの過去が嫌い」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の大切なものは、みっつ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"透子お姉ちゃん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お兄ちゃん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、水泳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"──それらのものを失ったとき、僕は、そしてあいつは？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73265"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73265","value":"水泳 　　ベタベタする事 　　透子と主人公"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73265","value":"水泳！ 　　格闘技を少々"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d5f483bcfc01811bafef687ff454fd26581261bca4894402dfeb3a75e5a83ca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/1714943def503f906e4228d76ef4d8cc2aaf370688ece1bc76115925038b1fae.webp","width":256,"height":255,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c3129","characterName":"お嬢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"73267","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15920"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26976"],"vndbCharacterId":"c3129"},"originalCharacterName":"お嬢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"808"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"１４０センチ"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"２６キロ"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a very eccentric-looking girl. Her name, age and nationality are all unknown. However, she seems to be looking for something so she prowls around the village. Contrary to her appearance, she acts very maturely. However, sometimes anachronisms show up in her conversation. For some reason, $1.00 equals 360 Yen in her mind. She also has an unbelievably huge appetite and even grills her favorite, corn on a cob, to enjoy by herself. She can always be found holding her stuffed animal, the cat \"Archimedes\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Grilling corn, hanging Teru teru bozus (good luck charms for good weather)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Grilled corn, steamed rice, old love songs"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Rain, fireworks (because they disappear too quickly)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Basic Behavior: Although she acts mature, she can be childish at times. She is always curious and hungry so she can easily be lured."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3129"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神社の軒先で寝泊まりしていたのを、不憫に思い拾われてきた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何かを探しているらしいのだが、探し物も自分の名前も忘れているために「お嬢」と呼ばれることになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく大食らいだったり、すぐに姿を消したり、人の言葉を理解する猫のぬいぐるみ（アルキメデス）を持っていたりと、とにかく謎の少女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26976","sourceWorkId":"3940","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エキセントリックな容姿の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国籍も年齢も名前も不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何か探しモノがあるらしく、村中をうろついている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見に似合わぬ大人びた言動なのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時折、時代錯誤した会話をすることもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の中では１ドル３６０円らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"信じられないくらい大飯ぐらいで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大好物の焼とうもろこしは、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分で七輪で焼いて食べていることもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"腕に抱くのは、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相棒のぬいぐるみ“アルキメデス”くん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"腹話術（？）なのか会話もできる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73267"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73267","value":"焼とうもろこし 　　ごはん 　　古いラヴソング"},{"label":"嫌いなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73267","value":"雨 　　花火（すぐに消えるから）"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73267","value":"とうもろこし焼き 　　てるてる坊主作り"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"birthday":[{"comparisonValue":"0808","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3129","value":"808"},{"comparisonValue":"0802","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26976","value":"8/2"},{"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73267","value":"８月２日（らしい）"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1e86aaf4163c74fafe134351dd4ac5f061b2586a4218c1be51fd941922a343e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c148b5aedfc81232a70884fbdb7f3ca4e341e0002e1d35c3ca51e19f7c51a86.webp","width":219,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c3132","characterName":"白河 さやか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"73264","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15920"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26973"],"vndbCharacterId":"c3132"},"originalCharacterName":"白河 さやか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"313"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"157cm"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"42kg"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sayaka is a fine young lady often misunderstood, ignored and hated by the villagers of Tokiwa because of her father, Ritsu-sensei, who is an eccentric painter that excels in the art of \"Death\". His passion for painting has also passed unto Sayaka. The painting world became a sanctuary for Sayaka and she is often seen painting at her family's art studio together with her only trusted friend Kamishiro Souji. Despite her seniority over Souji, she sometimes acts like his junior even to the point of asking him to be her tutor. When she feels tired or has nothing else to do, she is always seen taking a nap in the hammock near her house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Painting, naps (in a hammock)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Pumpkins, scarecrows (strange ones), long phone conversations"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Basic Behavior: She is honest to herself, gets angry easily, and overreacts to things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from MangaGamer and neo-X-saga's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3132"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"第二章登場のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"死をテーマに絵を描く父親を持つために、村で孤立している少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女は、持ち前の明るさで今日も元気に昼寝と散歩を繰り返していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがこの夏、さすがに落第のピンチを迎えたさやかは、学園と美術講の後輩である第二章主人公・上代蒼司に家庭教師をお願いすることに……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26973","sourceWorkId":"3940","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「死」をテーマに絵を描く偏屈な父親のために、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"村八分にされているお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"薄倖そうな外見の可憐さとは裏腹に、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情豊かで怒りっぽいため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いじめも何も、平気へっちゃら。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転は早いのだが勉強が苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その成績は紙一重で低い……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"このままでは落第してしまうので、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「後輩」である２章主人公に家庭教師を頼むことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かかしとアクセサリーが大好きなのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひまわりが大嫌い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73264"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73264","value":"かぼちゃ 　　かかし（変な物） 　　長電話"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73264","value":"絵描き 　　お昼寝（ハンモック）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b170511bc013b311b2e2b806a8e6fa48b2c2b0fe000c67a106b751bf2e7cd80.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abaa2ed474d496592f71e917c8df208d9f1eadc0e75b0bd021747abc81814b0b.webp","width":219,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12870","characterName":"稲葉 宏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12870"},"originalCharacterName":"稲葉 宏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Inaba Hiroshi had to leave his home as a child and live in an orphanage due to his family-related problems. When he heard that his father became seriously ill, he came back to Tokiwa village on the night of Tanabata (Star Festival). During that night, Hiroshi met a mysterious girl that is holding a black stuffed cat-like toy. The strange girl wearing black clothes and a black hat doesn't remember her own name but none of that will stop Hiroshi from spending more time with the girl and her stuffed cat, Archimedes. Hiroshi's special summer like none other in Tokiwa has just began."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12870"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f94a1ce249934df383dfeaa31717e1a0183b1183f97c9aae225c1cdc0ef2ac52.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34ba8e58d703ef37b37857a5f31ad4f4217014dcbbd7743ac3b5f2c355a772a5.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12876","characterName":"七条 華子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12876"},"originalCharacterName":"七条 華子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kako is Hiroshi and Chitose's half-sister. She is a very loud tomboyish girl that enjoys watching baseball matches and drinking late at night in a village bar. She is deeply devoted to one of the baseball teams that isn't very succesfull at the moment. Also, she likes to tease Hiroshi at times but despite her unusual personality and behavior, she is a rather kind person towards her half-sister Chitose. She will prove to be a very reliable person once she becomes the head of their family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Watching baseball in local bar, strolling around town insulting people (Akira in particular)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorites: Baseball, smoking, alcohol and other anti-straight edge things"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Behavior: A horrible ice queen with slight tsundere-like attributes. She can insult people to the core, but she doesn't let the other way around. Of course, lots of people are like that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from neo-X-saga's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12876"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9ba826963a1b2aa0f9054ce795a37c7340fb6ca3e4bcac87b3ab2e3a02471617.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e018281ba2b9a3556c6be45cd9c8aacb7c746dee3b33e5e73eddb06239c12e10.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29267","characterName":"マイシェラ＝クリスティン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29267"},"originalCharacterName":"マイシェラ＝クリスティン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"622"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fab123e6d3479e7bb98b88b7345dbb21f1cf0e8736f66febb20fec2ebbdaf91e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59bb52e2d4b1117f603931c7a57c75b2dd0625256e33535c78c06301feb573fb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29268","characterName":"レマ＝スタニスワフ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29268"},"originalCharacterName":"レマ＝スタニスワフ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b91162efd69188670a73484237a603b794086bca80243006593fb0d06796735.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/9972b07bec573f880792fb0f352daa7ef72291e15dcb8bdfd257e30597f83ce7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29269","characterName":"ソフィア＝イヴェール＝ラレンシア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29269"},"originalCharacterName":"ソフィア＝イヴェール＝ラレンシア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"925"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"47"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc7f01b9aaca154c145fc9b314837f82824072bccf734612891cd78646afd489.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1dd4c8f479990e01bcf2be190aadf60be4df016a1dfbfa6460ba79f02037d244.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3368","characterName":"水瀬 小夜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3368"},"originalCharacterName":"水瀬 小夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1017"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sayo is Itsuki's twin sister. Unlike her sister, she is very sociable and cheerful. She acts like a big sister to everyone and won’t stand for injustice, but she often acts before she thinks. She also holds special feelings towards Akira, but..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Playing with animals, pulling pranks and protecting Itsuki"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorites: Her twin sister (Itsuki), animals and Akira"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Behavior: Unlike her counterpart, she is very straightforward and overfriendly but can also be very harsh at times, too. She often acts without any thinking. But that's how all kids are, right?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from MangaGamer and neo-X-saga's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3368"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7df0647f7a70e78bf5c6bb3ba266f3ff82a12223b6602be47ab7caff20242f7c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74d73479fc4a4b9a549c2f97499baeed8d0d8c6c8556e158770f8d79ff178b7d.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3369","characterName":"稲葉 ちとせ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3369"},"originalCharacterName":"稲葉 ちとせ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chitose is Hiroshi's younger sister. She is very courageous and always puts others before herself. Since she is suffering from a serious heart defect, she can't even get out of her bed, but she is truly happy to hear that her brother returned to the village after such a long time. She can't make new friends because of her condition and so that's why she cherishes every moment that she can spend with her dearest brother and sister that are visiting her often. She will take a special liking to Oujo's stuffed cat-like doll, Archimedes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Reading shoujo manga, playing girly games (ayatori, shiritori, etc.)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorites: Onii-chan, Onee-chan, Ojou-chan, Archimedes...-chan?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Basic Behavior: Although she is suffering from a heart defection and is unable to leave her bed without significant aid, that doesn't stop her from being brave enough to fight her disease. She also cares dearly for people close to her more than she cares about herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from MangaGamer and neo-X-saga's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3369"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cccd868060b65b2e39288ca9367d9e4a768ade8724d6e10681c9f920df6ee28a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93d2ebed0f8f4e7931873d87d4b5c2d715c4dc1aac600f81c5d97fbbec915767.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3370","characterName":"アルキメデス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3370"},"originalCharacterName":"アルキメデス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Archimedes is a stuffed cat-like doll that Ojou carries around in her arms all the time. One of its strange abilities is that it is able to talk just like a normal human being albeit without opening its mouth. To a stranger, it appears like Ojou is using ventriloquism but that is not the case. It's not known why or how Archimedes is able to communicate with humans and its origin is certainly one big mystery. His main purpose appears to be that of Oujo's protector and a reliable traveling companion."}],"source":"vndb","sourceC